<span style="font-size: 24px;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><span style="font-size: 24px;">Please see the applications listed below.<br /><em><span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong>Note:</strong> Failure to use the most current applications may result in permit denial.&nbsp;</span></em></span></span></span><span style="background-color: #fbeeb8;">Please submit applications by email to bdepartment@chaffeecounty.org or by mail. Mailing address is P.O. Box 699, Salida, CO 81201.&nbsp;</span><br /><span style="font-size: 24px;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><em><span style="font-size: 16px;"><br /></span></em></span></span><br /><span style="font-size: 24px;">Current Applications</span><br /><br />
