<li><a href= "Documents/Departments/Building Department/Applications & Fees/Current Building Applications/Residential Final Packet June  2026 - CWRC update.pdf?t=202607141605570"  target="_blank"  >Residential Building Application (Updated 6-30-26)</a></li>
