<span style="font-size: 24px;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><br /><br /></span></span>
<h3>Permit Fee Payment Process</h3>
<p class="isSelectedEnd">Once your permit application has been received and all applicable fees have been verified, you will receive an invoice by email that includes a secure link to our online payment system. <span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #e03e2d;">Permit fees must be paid before your application can move forward.</span></p>
<p class="isSelectedEnd">After submitting your payment, please email our office to let us know your invoice has been paid. Once payment has been confirmed:</p>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li>Trade permits will be issued by email along with instructions for scheduling inspections.</li>
<li>Building permit applications will be moved into the building review process, provided all required documentation has been been received.</li>
</ul>
<p>Our online payment system provides a secure, convenient way to pay your permit fees at any time.</p>






        
           
